                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On October 20, 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre successfully hosted a seminar at Adhharshila Commerce Point, Vijay Vihar Phase-2, New Delhi. The event focused on introducing vocational courses to help students explore dynamic career paths and develop essential skills. The seminar was met with enthusiasm, with students eager to learn and discover new career possibilities.
                                    Skillbook’s experienced tutors led the session, providing valuable insights into courses like Graphic Design, Web Development, and Video Editing. They emphasized how these skills can boost career opportunities in today’s competitive job market. Engaging discussions and demonstrations gave students a clear understanding of each field's potential.
                                    The students left the seminar with smiles and appreciation, thanking Skillbook for this empowering experience. It was truly a memorable day filled with excitement, learning, and the promise of bright futures.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
